Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.44,0:23:30.24,ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur1}「最強の俺」it's my calling
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.24,0:22:19.00,ed zh,,0,0,0,,{\blur1}作为人类史上最弱的我闪亮登场
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.27,0:22:22.48,ed zh,,0,0,0,,{\blur1}渴望能从最底层处
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.48,0:22:23.59,ed zh,,0,0,0,,{\blur1}品尝一番仰望巅峰的滋味
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.59,0:22:25.55,ed zh,,0,0,0,,{\blur1\c&H1E1013&\1a&H00&\3c&HE6E6E6&\3a&H00&\bord0.5}品尝一番仰望巅峰的滋味
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.50,0:22:29.07,ed zh,,0,0,0,,{\blur1}无法让人眼前一亮的技能
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.13,0:22:30.76,ed zh,,0,0,0,,{\blur1}毫无印象点的面容
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.92,0:22:32.51,ed zh,,0,0,0,,{\blur1}身处最糟的境遇中
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.32,0:22:37.85,ed zh,,0,0,0,,{\blur1}丝毫没有新意的计划 疯狂的快感
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.98,0:22:42.22,ed zh,,0,0,0,,{\blur1}入侵我的大脑 强行脱离掌控
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.11,0:22:51.45,ed zh,,0,0,0,,{\blur1}真是抱歉 我要抛下你们先走了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.54,0:22:55.33,ed zh,,0,0,0,,{\blur1}我独自 独自升级 将超越极限吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.75,0:22:59.09,ed zh,,0,0,0,,{\blur1\c&H1E1013&\1a&H00&\3c&HE6E6E6&\3a&H00&\bord0.5}告别我的弱点 就此凌驾于属于自己的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.15,0:23:02.04,ed zh,,0,0,0,,{\blur1\c&H1E1013&\1a&H00&\3c&HE6E6E6&\3a&H00&\bord0.5}任何人都望尘莫及 进行无限的革命狩猎
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.04,0:23:05.89,ed zh,,0,0,0,,{\blur1}任何人都望尘莫及 进行无限的革命狩猎
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.89,0:23:13.30,ed zh,,0,0,0,,{\blur1}迎接属于我的勇敢 在崛起后便爆发
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.43,0:23:16.92,ed zh,,0,0,0,,{\blur1}就让我献上S级的营救吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.08,0:23:20.41,ed zh,,0,0,0,,{\blur1}若是能守护你的话
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.87,0:23:26.98,ed zh,,0,0,0,,{\blur1}最弱杰作降临
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.44,0:23:30.24,ed zh,,0,0,0,,{\blur1}「最强的我」即为我的使命
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.39,0:15:41.78,song,,0,0,0,,E dis rouy nomih ek a tuoy'd yhwdog?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.39,0:15:41.78,song,,0,0,0,,上帝啊 你为什么选择让他站在你的身边
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.78,0:15:50.65,song,,0,0,0,,Niap siht reffus ottub eic ohcon evahi
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.78,0:15:50.65,song,,0,0,0,,我别无选择 只能默默忍受这份痛苦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.93,0:16:20.76,song,,0,0,0,,You break the seals awaken the beast
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.93,0:16:20.76,song,,0,0,0,,你突破封印 唤醒野兽
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.76,0:16:28.27,song,,0,0,0,,I wish I'd been kept in the dark for it
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.76,0:16:28.27,song,,0,0,0,,我希望我对真相一无所知
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.27,0:16:35.03,song,,0,0,0,,Unknown side of me howling in outrage
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.27,0:16:35.03,song,,0,0,0,,不为人知的我愤怒地咆哮着
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.07,0:16:40.75,song,,0,0,0,,That cuts me to the bone
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.07,0:16:40.75,song,,0,0,0,,这一切令我痛彻心扉
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.83,0:17:28.94,song,,0,0,0,,Bursting though the pain of losing
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.83,0:17:28.94,song,,0,0,0,,强势出击 尽管承受着失败的痛苦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.94,0:17:31.33,song,,0,0,0,,Snapping the strings
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.94,0:17:31.33,song,,0,0,0,,扯断琴弦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.33,0:17:34.91,song,,0,0,0,,Wound up being faced the taboo
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.33,0:17:34.91,song,,0,0,0,,紧张不安 面对禁忌
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.91,0:17:38.47,song,,0,0,0,,Why am I cursed in vain?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.91,0:17:38.47,song,,0,0,0,,我为什么要徒劳无益地遭受诅咒
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.47,0:17:42.67,song,,0,0,0,,The chain of the chaotic world
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.47,0:17:42.67,song,,0,0,0,,背负着混乱世界的束缚
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.67,0:17:48.65,song,,0,0,0,,Have no choice but to confess on what they've held down
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.67,0:17:48.65,song,,0,0,0,,别无选择 只能坦白他们保守的秘密
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.24,0:17:55.40,song,,0,0,0,,How many times has my blood run cold?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.24,0:17:55.40,song,,0,0,0,,多少次我胆战心惊 毛骨悚然
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.56,0:18:01.62,song,,0,0,0,,How many nights I cry a river?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.56,0:18:01.62,song,,0,0,0,,多少个夜晚我失声痛哭 泪流满面
